WEBVTT

00:00:00.569 --> 00:00:02.030
Hello, salon owner!

00:00:02.131 --> 00:00:05.909
Would you like customers to book online by themselves, day and night,

00:00:05.859 --> 00:00:06.990
with no monthly fee?

00:00:07.417 --> 00:00:11.310
In this lesson, I'll show you how to register your salon on VaraaAi.

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:12.910
It takes just a few minutes.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:16.441
Once you verify your email, your salon is live straight away,

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:18.030
with no waiting for approval.

00:00:18.654 --> 00:00:20.833
Open varaaai.com.

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:23.313
On the home page, tap the line:

00:00:23.424 --> 00:00:24.273
Own a salon?

00:00:24.542 --> 00:00:26.433
Bring it to VaraaAi for free.

00:00:26.822 --> 00:00:29.233
Then tap Register your salon free.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:33.953
If you don't have an account yet, the first part of the page is Create your account:

00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:38.593
enter your full name, email, a password, and the password once more.

00:00:39.187 --> 00:00:41.157
Next, your salon's details.

00:00:41.506 --> 00:00:46.542
Enter the Business name, write a Short description, and choose a Service category,

00:00:46.492 --> 00:00:47.637
for example nails,

00:00:47.743 --> 00:00:49.157
hair, or spa.

00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:54.197
Then enter the Address, choose the Country and the City, and add your Phone number.

00:00:54.546 --> 00:00:58.517
Note that the country sets the time zone of your calendar, so choose it carefully.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.214
Check everything, then tap Submit application.

00:01:02.313 --> 00:01:04.214
VaraaAi sends you an email.

00:01:04.406 --> 00:01:09.174
Open it, tap the button to verify your email, and your salon is activated at once.

00:01:09.434 --> 00:01:12.774
If you can't find the email, look in your spam or promotions folder.

00:01:13.394 --> 00:01:17.381
After that, open your dashboard, and start adding your services,

00:01:17.331 --> 00:01:18.857
staff and opening hours.

00:01:19.206 --> 00:01:21.897
The next lessons in the Academy walk you through each part.

00:01:22.078 --> 00:01:25.257
Congratulations, your salon is on VaraaAi!

00:01:25.555 --> 00:01:26.777
Now take the quiz below.
